# their context but copy only the workspace and contrib/: everything else,
# such as .git, target/, vendor/qemu and local checkouts, stays out of the
# context.
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!projects
!contrib
__pycache__
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
